  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "NO ONE LIVES HERE\nYou are a 21-year-old aspiring video essayist investigating
    the disappearance of the Abercrombie family, who vanished without a trace from
    their home on Blackthorn Lane in October 2006.\nWith permission from the property's
    current owner, you have been granted access to the house to document its history
    and uncover what happened to its former residents.\nFive people disappeared that
    night: Hamish and Neema Abercrombie, and their three children.\nDecades later,
    no explanation has ever been found.\nYour task is to explore the house, examine
    its contents, and piece together the evidence left behind.\nPerhaps you'll finally
    discover what happened to the Abercrombies.\nAfter all, no one lives here anymore. 
    \n\n\n\n PRESS ESC AND CLICK TO CLOSE INTRODUCTION\n\n"
