--- !u!114 &6630786550400602308
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5465653310656753156}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 367689ee5044f384f90357a5791dcf2e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::JournalItem
  journalText: "Journal \r\n15 November 2006 -19 December 2006 \r\nHamish Abercrombie
    \r\n17 November \r\nNeema says we should leave. I asked her where we would go,
    \r\nand she said anywhere else. James has stopped speaking to \r\nme. Tulia refuses
    to paint. Samuel has not left our bedroom \r\nin three days. \r\n19 November
    \r\nNeema says I am losing my mind. She says I have not slept \r\nproperly in
    a week. I tried to explain that the thing is not \r\npretending to be our son.
    \r\nIt is our son. \r\nShe slapped me. \r\nI deserved it. \r\nI think. \r\n25
    November \r\nThere are five of us in this house. \r\nThere must be. \r\nI counted
    them this morning. \r\nI counted them again at dinner. \r\nNeema, James, Tulia,
    Samuel. \r\nAnd me. \r\nYet there are six shadows on the landing."
